     The spawn-sigdefault attribute represents the set of signals to be forced
     to default signal handling in the new process image (if
     POSIX_SPAWN_SETSIGDEF is set in the spawn-flags attribute) by a spawn op‐
     eration.  The default value of this attribute is an empty signal set.

